{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Ultimate cute clicker game\u2665\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Kawaii Clicker&quot; is a clicker game where you produce hearts with cute characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's click the girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clicking will increase the gauge and enter &quot;Fever Mode&quot;, which has a production bonus effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the hearts you collect to purchase mysterious items and produce even more hearts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sex scenes are LIVE 2D Animation!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What? Why collect hearts...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's to watch the cute character animations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's fill the world with kawaii\u2665!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566540/extras/gif02_fever.gif?t=1743903914\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Fever Mode\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Normal Fever: Powerful bonuses to heart production and click production!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultra Fever: Super powerful production bonus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click Fever: Bonus to production with repeated clicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gatling Fever: Bonus to item production every 6 clicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monster Fever: Defeat monsters! Attack with repeated clicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spin Fever: Spin the magic circle! Earn tons of hearts with each spin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slot Fever: Match 3 slot numbers to earn tons of hearts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566540/extras/gif01_monster_1.gif?t=1743903914\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Mini-games\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm: Use hearts to grow and harvest crops. Crops will increase your production while they are growing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bingo: Draw numbers to get bingo! A chance to get lots of hearts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rebirth: A strong new game! Increase your production and click more efficiently!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566540/extras/gif03_farm.gif?t=1743903914\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Appealing points\u3011</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mix of traditional clicker game style and cute character animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchasing upgrades will dramatically increase your heart production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A chance to get lots of hearts in &quot;Fever Mode&quot;!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get even more hearts in &quot;Ultra Fever Mode&quot;!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3566540?t=1743903914","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566540/544b52070aeac5dea8ac035e45f85af07122b901/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743903914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566540/101a04b2bfbb6a3016a6d8a7257fda8389567ebd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743903914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566540/101a04b2bfbb6a3016a6d8a7257fda8389567ebd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743903914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Sexual acts\r\nSex scenes"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u3010Ultimate cute clicker game\u2665\